{"id":"4afc8517bfa0c07e","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-product.md","title":"ZFC Tree10 Tree Product","display":"df-zfc-tree10-tree-product — ZFC Tree10 Tree Product","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-product","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-product"],"display":"df-zfc-tree10-tree-product — ZFC Tree10 Tree Product","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]","[[58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product]]","[[58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code]]","[[58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree10-tree-product — ZFC Tree10 Tree Product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"925588f7d7cb9abb\" href=\"?note=925588f7d7cb9abb\" title=\"58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product\">58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c7cf057d5daacec1\" href=\"?note=c7cf057d5daacec1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code\">58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"44c6814fd2d8eda0\" href=\"?note=44c6814fd2d8eda0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md\">58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,T,U,P,p,t,u\\in V\">\\(R,T,U,P,p,t,u\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\)</span> (tree-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetopCartesianProduct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetopCartesianProduct}_S\\)</span> (Cartesian-product predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"925588f7d7cb9abb\" href=\"?note=925588f7d7cb9abb\" title=\"58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product\">58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S\\)</span> (ordered-pair predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c7cf057d5daacec1\" href=\"?note=c7cf057d5daacec1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code\">58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeProduct}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeProduct}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"44c6814fd2d8eda0\" href=\"?note=44c6814fd2d8eda0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md\">58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md</a>；序数索引函数的长度为其定义域，允许有限及超限长度。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}tree\\text{-}product} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeProduct}_S(R,T,U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in T\\times T:a\\subseteq b\\})\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(U,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in U\\times U:a\\subseteq b\\})\\land(\\forall t\\in T\\cup U\\;\\exists\\alpha,A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(t,\\alpha,A))\\land\\exists P\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcSetopCartesianProduct}_S(P,T,U)\\land\\forall p\\;(p\\in R\\leftrightarrow p\\in P\\land\\exists t\\in T\\;\\exists u\\in U\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S(p,t,u)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(t)=\\operatorname{dom}(u))))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}tree\\text{-}product} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeProduct}_S(R,T,U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in T\\times T:a\\subseteq b\\})\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(U,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in U\\times U:a\\subseteq b\\})\\land(\\forall t\\in T\\cup U\\;\\exists\\alpha,A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(t,\\alpha,A))\\land\\exists P\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcSetopCartesianProduct}_S(P,T,U)\\land\\forall p\\;(p\\in R\\leftrightarrow p\\in P\\land\\exists t\\in T\\;\\exists u\\in U\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S(p,t,u)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(t)=\\operatorname{dom}(u))))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> is exactly the levelwise product: its nodes are pairs of nodes from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> having equal length.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product","status":"resolved","id":"925588f7d7cb9abb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code","status":"resolved","id":"c7cf057d5daacec1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"44c6814fd2d8eda0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S$ (tree-order predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product","status":"resolved","id":"925588f7d7cb9abb","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSetopCartesianProduct}_S$ (Cartesian-product predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-setop-cartesian-product]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code","status":"resolved","id":"c7cf057d5daacec1","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S$ (ordered-pair predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"44c6814fd2d8eda0","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S$ 使用 [[58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-indexed-sequence.md]]；序数索引函数的长度为其定义域，允许有限及超限长度。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"R,T,U,P,p,t,u\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSetopCartesianProduct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeProduct}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}tree\\text{-}product} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeProduct}_S(R,T,U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in T\\times T:a\\subseteq b\\})\\land \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(U,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in U\\times U:a\\subseteq b\\})\\land(\\forall t\\in T\\cup U\\;\\exists\\alpha,A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalIndexedSequence}_S(t,\\alpha,A))\\land\\exists P\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcSetopCartesianProduct}_S(P,T,U)\\land\\forall p\\;(p\\in R\\leftrightarrow p\\in P\\land\\exists t\\in T\\;\\exists u\\in U\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12KuratowskiPairCode}_S(p,t,u)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(t)=\\operatorname{dom}(u))))","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false}],"bytes":1908,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3779","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-product.md|58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-product]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d25b709595952a78","925588f7d7cb9abb","c7cf057d5daacec1","44c6814fd2d8eda0"]}